### Run DemoSmoke first to execute all assertions and save actual keys in target/demo-state.json.
### Full demo resets data; verifyOnly reads saved state and checks persistence without resetting.
### PowerShell: .\mvnw.cmd -B "-Dtest=DemoSmoke" "-Ddemo.baseUrl=http://localhost:8080" test
### Restart check: add "-Ddemo.verifyOnly=true" to the same command after restarting from this project.
### The HTTP client captures the first response key; never replace it with an example key.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = demo-only-token

### Health
< {%
  // Business dates are generated at run time in Asia/Hong_Kong (UTC+8).
  const hongKongNow = Date.now() + 8 * 60 * 60 * 1000;
  client.global.set("from", new Date(hongKongNow).toISOString().slice(0, 10));
  client.global.set("to", new Date(hongKongNow + 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000).toISOString().slice(0, 10));
%}
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### This explicitly resets current demo data. Run only when ready for a new demonstration.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create first link; supported by JetBrains HTTP Client.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/links
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":1001,"sharerId":"user_001","channel":"wechat"}

> {%
  client.global.set("key", response.body.key);
  client.test("Created", function () { client.assert(response.status === 201); });
%}

### Same tuple reuses the actual saved key.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/links
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":1001,"sharerId":"user_001","channel":"wechat"}

### Card and image do not count PV.
GET {{baseUrl}}/c/{{key}}

### Valid PNG
GET {{baseUrl}}/media/products/1001.png

### HEAD does not issue a visitor Cookie or count PV.
HEAD {{baseUrl}}/s/{{key}}

### Disable automatic redirects in your HTTP client; the server must return 302 + no-store.
# @no-redirect
GET {{baseUrl}}/s/{{key}}?channel=other&sharerId=mallory
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 MicroMessenger/8.0

### Follow Location manually; attribution comes from stored data.
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1001?channel=wechat&sharerId=user_001

### Global distinct UV; update dates above. DemoSmoke derives both automatically in Asia/Hong_Kong.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats?from={{from}}&to={{to}}&groupBy=channel,sharerId
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Visitor B sends no existing browser Cookie; the saved cookie jar remains visitor A.
# @no-cookie-jar
# @no-redirect
GET {{baseUrl}}/s/{{key}}
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 MicroMessenger/8.0

### Create another channel, then use the same browser Cookie for its click.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/links
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":1001,"sharerId":"bob","channel":"moments"}

> {% client.global.set("secondKey", response.body.key); %}

### Same visitor across channels remains one global UV.
# @no-redirect
GET {{baseUrl}}/s/{{secondKey}}

### Legal but absent key (if it happens to match a generated key, choose another legal Base62 value).
GET {{baseUrl}}/s/1

### Invalid canonical key -> friendly404.
GET {{baseUrl}}/s/000

### Empty title; seeded product1002 already has a missing image reference.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/products/1002
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":""}

### Create fallback card.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/links
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":1002,"sharerId":"fallback","channel":"other"}

> {% client.global.set("fallbackKey", response.body.key); %}

### Server outputs 精选商品 and a usable og:image.
GET {{baseUrl}}/c/{{fallbackKey}}

### Missing product image returns the built-in default PNG with200.
GET {{baseUrl}}/media/products/1002.png

### Off-shelf preserves old short links and card metadata.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/products/1001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"OFF_SHELF"}

###410 and no additional PV.
# @no-redirect
GET {{baseUrl}}/s/{{key}}

###200 with 商品暂不可购买.
GET {{baseUrl}}/c/{{key}}

### Deleted product still has a friendly old card.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/products/1001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###410 remains after delete and after restart.
# @no-redirect
GET {{baseUrl}}/s/{{key}}

###200 with 商品已不可用.
GET {{baseUrl}}/c/{{key}}

### After restarting: query without reset; use saved dates and keys from target/demo-state.json.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats?from={{from}}&to={{to}}&groupBy=channel,sharerId
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Repeat rapidly to observe429 + integer Retry-After; DemoSmoke performs the bounded burst itself.
GET {{baseUrl}}/c/1
